{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Escape to a paradisiacal island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine casting your line into crystal-clear waters, enjoying the sun as you relax fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't just any fishing trip \u2013 it's an unforgettable adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being separated from your soulmate by some mysterious purple light, you become friends with Fongfan, a dragon whelp. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, complete quests and unlock achievements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Fongfan to transform into an adult dragon and unravel the mystery of the purple lights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in rare fish and story-rich treasures, and compare your collection with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play without an account, or sign in to save your progress across all your devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the game to relax and live a memorable adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to play<br>Click on a fish to begin fishing. Hold the reel to fish faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/f3018402c09b0d0eb7b8be8572194a4c.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/f3018402c09b0d0eb7b8be8572194a4c.webm?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/f3018402c09b0d0eb7b8be8572194a4c.mp4?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Fish them all!<br>Collect more than 90 treasures that have been teleported to your planet by the mysterious purple lights. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/699e991d399272073ede53816b20830a.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/699e991d399272073ede53816b20830a.webm?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/699e991d399272073ede53816b20830a.mp4?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Visit your friend's inventory<br>Compare your collection with your friends! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/5eaaffd4955f24e3a1c75fd8d0113e04.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=608 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/5eaaffd4955f24e3a1c75fd8d0113e04.webm?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/5eaaffd4955f24e3a1c75fd8d0113e04.mp4?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 Help a dragon<br>Help a dragon whelp transform into a fully grown dragon by completing quests. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/e7e5651fe264cb15badec7d06fa507a9.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=608 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/e7e5651fe264cb15badec7d06fa507a9.webm?t=1768541850\" 