 would love to work with an artist, but I don't have the budget yet.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bamboo fishing pole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/72994164e90830c666d7e0741ab4e2ce31a700b6.jpg"},{"name":"Ari and Alex's pillows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/e15d55207a2396760325cd9b787af1af3d04fa7a.jpg"},{"name":"Balancing pebbles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/dee53ff15673b1d90d71ac255870769fb38b1482.jpg"},{"name":"Shooting star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/8eed3e4ccfe857f496b94e556cf5cbe6e663f22b.jpg"},{"name":"Ari's necklace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/6d20fd2465aaf099e41678e3f0e1b9f152ca61c8.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon tear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/78b383889b54a9c0b98f9f8f9c32951cd6e4292f.jpg"},{"name":"Alex's message","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/d4fecbf3a31568032aa283fbe7d36eb6354b4e83.jpg"},{"name":"Multiverse breach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/8fdcd6ed448dfd1c11e2e629a33ea1e404ea6abd.jpg"},{"name":"Couple teddy bears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/7108262ef6f86973be8e10d258e6c996fee9bf3e.jpg"},{"name":"Couple coconut drinks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3907050/9e934a9859d820370407eafbd2c9c488c46ff644.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907050?t=1768541850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/e2f0809cac1742da2334fa7925f132abd21e0217/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768541850","capsule_image":"h