=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/f3018402c09b0d0eb7b8be8572194a4c.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/f3018402c09b0d0eb7b8be8572194a4c.webm?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/f3018402c09b0d0eb7b8be8572194a4c.mp4?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Fish them all!<br>Collect more than 90 treasures that have been teleported to your planet by the mysterious purple lights. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/699e991d399272073ede53816b20830a.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/699e991d399272073ede53816b20830a.webm?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/699e991d399272073ede53816b20830a.mp4?t=1768541850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Visit your friend's inventory<br>Compare your collection with your friends! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/5eaaffd4955f24e3a1c75fd8d0113e04.poster.avif?t=1768541850\" width=608 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/extras/5eaaffd4955f24e3a1c75fd8d0113e04.w